sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Client
    participant G as api-gateway
    participant I as incident-service
    participant DB as incident_db
    participant R as responder-service
    participant RDB as responder_db
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant N as notification-service
    C->>G: POST /api/incidents (Bearer JWT)
    G->>G: verify JWT, strip forged X-User-* headers, add trusted ones
    G->>I: POST /incidents (lb:// picks one incident-service copy)
    I->>DB: INSERT incident, status REPORTED (commit)
    I->>R: POST /internal/responders/assign (circuit breaker, 1 s connect / 2 s read)
    R->>RDB: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED, set BUSY (one transaction)
    R-->>I: 200 responder Ambulance Alpha
    I->>DB: UPDATE status ASSIGNED (commit)
    I-)MQ: publish incident.assigned (fire and forget)
    I-->>G: 201 ASSIGNED
    G-->>C: 201 ASSIGNED + responder
    MQ-)N: deliver event
    N->>N: skip if eventId already stored, else INSERT notification